PARSE TREE;
how do i use union for this
	1) mnemonic
		tokens this type covers:
			INST
			REG

	3) blockStuffs
		tokens this type covers:
			DATASEGMENTSTART 
			INSTSEGMENTSTART 
			LINKSEGMENTSTART 
			END

	4) variablesStuffs
		tokens this type covers:
			DATA_TYPE
			BIN
			HEX
			NUM
			IDENTIFIER 
			EQUALS 
			POINTER_EQUALS 

	5) lableStuff
		tokens this type covers:
			LABELDEF
			LABELREF

parse tree structure:

	root			=> blockstuffs

	blockstuffs		=>  DATASEGMENTSTART 
					=>  INSTSEGMENTSTART 
					=>  LINKSEGMENTSTART 
					=>  END
					=>  mnemonic
					=>  labelStuffs

	labelStuffs		=>  LABELDEF
					=>  LABELREF
					=>  mnemonic

	mnemonic		=> s by the compiler. For example, it may s
